Someone actually had the idea, David, you
should do on your twitch stream when whenever

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:07.410
you launch it, you should just do like personal
finance stuff.

00:07:07.410 --> 00:07:12.159
Since your background is in personal finance
from Grad school, it's an interesting idea.

00:07:12.159 --> 00:07:15.550
I think I'm just kind of out of the game and
I wouldn't really be the right person to be

00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:19.400
giving that kind of advice, which could be
funny in a sense, but I also don't want to

00:07:19.400 --> 00:07:19.950
damage anybody's financial circumstances.

